NOTICE OF PARTNER ASSIGNMENT

By order of the Leader, you are hereby assigned to a two-man cell. Your partner's
identity is disclosed to you and to no other. You will travel, contract, and
extract together until reassigned.

You are not required to like your partner. You are required to keep him alive long
enough to complete the mission, and to ensure he keeps you alive in turn. Watch him.
He watches you. This is by design.

Disputes between partners are settled without killing. A dead partner is a lost
asset and a lost ring-bearer, and you will answer to the Leader for the gap in the
sealing circle. Report all friction; do not resolve it with blood.

- Issued under the authority of Pain
